EncoBudsTray
Copyright 2026 @bharathvsnair

This project is an independent Windows tray application for displaying
battery information from OPPO Enco Buds2 earbuds.

Third-party acknowledgements
============================

Gadgetbridge
------------
EncoBudsTray's Bluetooth protocol implementation was independently
implemented with technical reference to the [Gadgetbridge](https://gadgetbridge.org/)
 project,
particularly its OPPO Enco Buds2 support.

Gadgetbridge is an independent open-source project and is licensed under
the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0).

This project does not include or redistribute Gadgetbridge source code.



OBudsManager
------------
The existence and general concept of the community [OBudsManager](https://github.com/siddhesh17b/OBudsManager)
project served as inspiration for this project.

No protocol implementation or source code from OBudsManager was used
in EncoBudsTray.